<Events>
    <!--Campaign: Amthor. Created by Sil taTener-->
	<Warlord side="1" name="Lord Restorn" city="Renunburg" level="15" portrait="27" major="1" minor="0">
	</Warlord>

	<Warlord side="2" name="Oh&apos;rtrak" city="K'skuluur" level="15" portrait="03" major="0" minor="0">
	</Warlord>

	<Warlord side="3" name="Nugnartok" city="Ch'Arghoor" level="14" portrait="09" major="0" minor="1">
	</Warlord>

	<Warlord side="4" name="Chulkasik" city="Chun-ar" level="13" portrait="23" major="0" minor="2">
	</Warlord>


    <!--Story start-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="turn" data1="1"/>
		<Message>你终于回到陆地，却没能达成此行的目的。|古龙基林仍然活着，|还告诉你那枚护符竟是食人魔替希安特拉打造的！|你必须弄清究竟是谁在说谎。|你已经派使者去见希安特拉，要求她交出护符。你要亲自判断真相。|等待使者归来期间，你决定调查巨人丘陵。此行不能带上黑暗精灵，看来你再也不能信任任何人。|不过，你毕竟是一名召唤师。</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="w1"/>
	</Event>


	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="turn_or_later" data1="10"/>
		<Trigger type="chance" data1="20"/>
		<Message>你仍未收到使者的消息。看来他可能遭遇了麻烦……</Message>
	</Event>


    <!--Spider start-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="33"/>
		<Message>黑暗精灵的前哨站？！这可让你浮想联翩……</Message>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="36">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="36"/>
		<Message>你找到一扇通往黑暗位面的传送门，|它会改善你的魔力流动……</Message>
		<Action type="particle" string1="BlackCapitol"/>
		<Action type="mana_crystals" data1="2"/>
	</Event>

    <!--Spider reinforcement-->
	<Event side="2" repeat="20" location="city" locdata="16">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="w1"/>
		<Action type="unit" data1="36" data2="1" data3="4"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="3" repeat="20" location="city" locdata="20">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="w1"/>
		<Action type="unit" data1="36" data2="1" data3="4"/>
	</Event>


    <!-- Warlord Win Option -->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="1">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="20"/>
		<Action type="counter_add" data1="1" String1="w1"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="1">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="16"/>
		<Action type="counter_add" data1="1" String1="w1"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="5">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="5"/>
		<Message>摆脱那些臭烘烘的兽人，总是一件令人愉快的事……</Message>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="5">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="4"/>
		<Message>看来你引起了骑士团和帝国的注意。|他们总在你身后紧追不舍，可究竟为什么？</Message>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="2">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="w1"/>
		<Message>你击倒了那名巨人统帅，搜查他的堡垒。|巨龙说得没错：|食人魔确实掌握着制作魔法物品的技艺。可是，|仍没有证据表明他们与希安特拉有关……|至少现在没有。</Message>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="2">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="2" String1="w1"/>
		<Message>你费了好大力气才击败这名巨人！毫无疑问，|黑暗精灵曾暗中援助他。你再次搜查堡垒，|在统帅的房间里发现一只木箱，|里面藏着一封信——信上盖着希安特拉的印章！|不论信是否伪造，现在都该去找那名精灵，当面质问调查所得。当然……还有你那名使者的下落！|接下来进入《阿姆索尔 10》……</Message>
		<Action type="victory" data1="0"/>
	</Event>

</Events>
